# Byte fidelity for this bundle.
#
# The record deliberately mixes line endings: the node documents are CRLF and the
# annex documents are LF, and the repairs were verified byte-for-byte against the
# pre-repair baseline. The machine-level core.autocrlf is true on this host, which
# would silently rewrite every file on checkout. Marking everything as non-text for
# end-of-line purposes keeps the committed bytes identical to the working tree.
* -text
